# Client-side routing.
#
# Every path the router owns must be served index.html so a deep link or a
# refresh on /group/awards loads the app instead of 404ing. The 200 is what
# makes it a rewrite rather than a redirect, so the URL the user typed is the
# URL the router sees.
#
# /api/* is deliberately NOT covered: Pages Functions answer those, and a
# catch-all here would hand the browser an HTML page where it expects JSON —
# the scanner would fail with a parse error instead of a readable message.
/*    /index.html   200
